OL,3,GNEWSASearch continues for boat and crew
OL,4,A'in distress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescue efforts are continuing for a
OL,7,Fvessel in distress in the English
OL,8,FChannel as two crew members remain
OL,9,Fmissing, the Maritime and Coastguard
OL,10,FAgency has said.
OL,12,FA coastguard rescue helicopter, fixed
OL,13,Fwing plane and two RNLI lifeboats began
OL,14,Fsearching an area south-west of
OL,15,FEddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth
OL,16,Fshortly after 18:00 BST on Saturday
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
