OL,3,GNEWSASearch continues for boat and crew
OL,4,A'in distress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update early on Sunday, HM
OL,7,FCoastguard in Falmouth confirmed three
OL,8,Fof the five people aboard the boat had
OL,9,Fnow been accounted for. It did not
OL,10,Fshare further information about the
OL,11,Fvessel or the nature of the emergency.
OL,13,FA large number of civilian vessels were
OL,14,Fassisting the "intensive search", a HM
OL,15,FCoastguard spokesperson added.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
